arget":"#mcetoc_1f9c7kil42t","line":19},{"title":"10\\. Where can I find information about the latest release?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9c7kil42u","line":20},{"title":"11\\. If I am in the middle of an upgrade, how does this affect my usual patching schedule?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9c7kil52v","line":21},{"title":"12\\. What if the upgrade is scheduled during a change freeze?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9c7kil530","line":22},{"title":"13\\. Who do I contact for questions and issues related to my upgrade schedule?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9c7kil531","line":23},{"title":"how to use our Reservation Calendar.","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0541128","line":55},{"title":"ServiceNow Product Documentation","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/ \"ServiceNow Product Documentation\"","line":67},{"title":"Now Community","target":"https://community.servicenow.com/community/product-launch/patching \"Now Community\"","line":79},{"title":"Legal Customer Agreements","target":"http://www.servicenow.com/schedules.html \"Legal Customer Agreements\"","line":87},{"title":"ServiceNow Release Cycle","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0547244 \"ServiceNow Release Cycle\"","line":88},{"title":"Upgrades & Patching Community","target":"https://community.servicenow.com/community?id=community_forum&sys_id=71291a2ddbd897c068c1fb651f9619c8 \"Upgrades & Patching Community\"","line":89},{"title":"Patching & Upgrades Program - Definition of Unsupported Release","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0598977 \"Patching & Upgrades Program - Definition of Unsupported Release\"","line":90},{"title":"Upgrade to the latest family","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/csh?topicname=upgrade.html&version=latest \"Upgrade to the latest family\"","line":91}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
